# ghost-concierge

The sales page for Ghost Concierge, an AI travel companion pitched as part of Ghost OS in May 2026.

One `index.html` in the Ghost OS design, committed on May 2, 2026. It is a marketing page only; there is no concierge code here, and nothing runs from it. The concierge idea later continued in [`Just-do-it`](https://github.com/CultureReset/Just-do-it) (Gulfside) and the Gulf Coast Radar concierge in [`gcr-unified`](https://github.com/CultureReset/gcr-unified).

Open `index.html` in a browser to see it.
